@startuml
title Phase 1 final — CLI 模块依赖
skinparam linetype ortho

package "cli" {
  [Repl]
  [Parser]
}
package "commands" {
  [CommandRegistry]
  [Concrete Commands]
}
package "editor" {
  [Editor]
}
package "io" {
  [SvgReader]
  [SvgWriter]
}
package "model" {
  [Document]
  [ShapeFactory]
  [Shape / Group]
  [Concrete Shapes]
}

[Repl] --> [Parser]
[Repl] --> [CommandRegistry]
[CommandRegistry] --> [Concrete Commands]
[Concrete Commands] --> [Editor]
[Concrete Commands] --> [CommandRegistry] : undo/redo/help
[Editor] --> [SvgReader]
[Editor] --> [SvgWriter]
[Editor] --> [Document]
[Editor] --> [ShapeFactory]
[SvgReader] --> [ShapeFactory]
[SvgReader] --> [Document]
[SvgWriter] --> [Document]
[ShapeFactory] --> [Concrete Shapes]
[Document] --> [Shape / Group]
[Shape / Group] <|-- [Concrete Shapes]

note right of [Editor]
会话状态、编辑操作与 IO 集中；
新增领域能力需要修改既有模块。
end note
@enduml
